# Save the Children (battlefield.save_the_children): the entry menu's guards. A level 75 Warrior of San d'Oria with
# 1-3 current at Status 2 (GMs). Hut_Door: the menu 32000. Option 255: redirectEventUpdate's `option == 255` operand
# (its own operand beside 0): ignored, no reply. Option 17 (index 1, not in the menu): REQS_NOT_MET. Finished:
# redirectEventCall: no battlefield and no battlefieldID local var yet (0): it returns. The menu again: area 1,
# entered (autoSkipCS 0), finished: the CS local var 1; onBattlefieldEnter set battlefieldID 32. The Fodderchiefs
# killed: won, 32001, finished (1-3: the key, the title, Status 3); out after the cleanup. GMs: the key dropped,
# Status 2, and the CS local var (Battlefield[32]CS) set back to 0 (battlefieldID stays 32: no zone change). The menu,
# option 17: REQS_NOT_MET; finished: redirectEventCall finds battlefieldID 32 and calls Save the Children's
# onEventFinishEnter, whose guard (no battlefield: the menu gave no arena) returns before setEnteredBattlefield and the
# CS var. The menu once more, area 1: entered with autoSkipCS 0 (0x05C [2,0,0,24,1], the first win's record): the
# guarded finish left the CS var at 0; without the guard it would read 100. No timing or RNG dependency.
lists GhelsbaOutpost/Hut_Door/onTrigger GhelsbaOutpost/onEventUpdate/32000 GhelsbaOutpost/onEventFinish/32000 GhelsbaOutpost/onEventFinish/32001
char zone=GhelsbaOutpost pos=-163.5,-11.7,77.8 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
mission Sandoria SmashTheOrcishScouts completed
mission Sandoria BatHunt completed
mission Sandoria SaveTheChildren current
login
missionstatus Sandoria 2                # a GM
trigger Hut_Door                        # the menu 32000
update 32000 option=255                 # 255: ignored
update 32000 option=17                  # index 1, not in the menu: REQS_NOT_MET
finish                                  # no battlefield, battlefieldID 0: nothing
trigger Hut_Door                        # the menu 32000
update 32000 option=1                   # area 1: entered (autoSkipCS 0)
finish                                  # in the arena: the CS var 1
tick 2000                               # the Fodderchiefs spawn
kill FODDERCHIEF_VOKDEK
kill FODDERCHIEF_VOKDEK+1
kill FODDERCHIEF_VOKDEK+2               # won: 32001
finish                                  # 1-3: the key, the title, Status 3
tick 11000                              # the won arena's cleanup
tick 10000                              # out of the battlefield
delkeyitem OrcishHutKey                 # a GM
missionstatus Sandoria 2                # a GM
localvar Battlefield[32]CS 0            # a GM: the CS var back to 0
trigger Hut_Door                        # the menu 32000
update 32000 option=17                  # REQS_NOT_MET
finish                                  # battlefieldID 32: onEventFinishEnter: no battlefield: returns
trigger Hut_Door                        # the menu 32000
update 32000 option=1                   # entered: autoSkipCS 0 (the CS var still 0)
finish                                  # in the arena
